<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR AUG 4/5.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR AUG 4/5.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on Monday set</p>
<p>the following currency fixings for August 5. The litas is pegged</p>
<p>to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   05.08.97	  04.08.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5144	    6.5596</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.1453	    2.1656</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.2366	    4.2750</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.3805	    3.3571</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.4979	    0.5002</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7192	    0.7256</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2683	    0.2707</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.8184	    6.8289</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6895	    0.6894</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.1561	    1.1503</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
